试验药低剂量组:安慰剂组=2:1:1。","rationale":"样本量参数（α=0.10、效能85%、每组85例、总计255例、含约10%脱落补偿）及随机化比例2:1:1均由项目已确认研究事实直接给出。NT-proBNP变化百分比的组间差值假设值与合并标准差未在已确认研究事实中明确列出，当前正文仅引用了最终估算结果；若需展示完整计算过程，需补充原始假设参数。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（样本量）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_cfa0c74fd152_30b21fd10cd873ce","section_number":"9.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:76fb9f6f54c6630b5532b2f9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_38af9a3da602952b599f:r7:a3fd7ab767640a11","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9691f7c94f6c58","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9895ed0bd2ffd4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"79b9b6799bbc8e3eb5ba93bb02071fd003f75aa4918aea72ae078c97be3718b1","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_cfa0c74fd152_8da7757297dced36:full-draft:76fb9f6f54c6630b5532b2f9","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:76fb9f6f54c6630b5532b2f9","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:117560101db1e47f594d905644303284433ed2af23812133b5006c4338e03c31:76fb9f6f54c6630b5532b2f9","text_sha256":"79b9b6799bbc8e3eb5ba93bb02071fd003f75aa4918aea72ae078c97be3718b1"},{"content_sha256":"20c8729f60dff625677c49ffc7ab286aafe054d33280a6459750fca3289a6963","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_38af9a3da602952b599f:revision:7","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_38af9a3da602952b599f:r7:a3fd7ab767640a11","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_38af9a3da602952b599f:r7:a3fd7ab767640a11","text_sha256":"20c8729f60dff625677c49ffc7ab286aafe054d33280a6459750fca3289a6963"},{"conten